   Linux version script of libneoj2k.so: the C API (nj2k_*) and nothing else. The node is the ABI
   generation; 1.0 starts NJ2K_1.0, and later minor versions add nodes that inherit from it. */
NJ2K_0 {
  global:
    nj2k_*;
  local:
    *;
};
